# HTML Markup Layout

When writing or editing HTML and Thymeleaf templates:

## Element line breaks

- Put each element on its **own line** for readability.
- Do not cram multiple sibling elements onto one line.
- Keep parent–child nesting clear with consistent indentation.
- Inline text nodes may stay on the same line as their wrapping element when the content is short.

```html
<!-- ❌ BAD -->
<section class="page-head"><h1>설문 관리</h1><p>설문 마스터를 관리합니다.</p></section>

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<section class="page-head">
    <h1>설문 관리</h1>
    <p>설문 마스터를 관리합니다.</p>
</section>
```

## Block grouping

- Separate **major block sections** with **one blank line** (double line break between groups).
- Use this between layout regions such as header, search panel, list table, action bar, and footer actions.
- Do not add blank lines between every sibling element inside the same block.

```html
<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<!-- 페이지 헤더 시작 -->
<section class="page-head">
    <h1>설문 관리</h1>
    <p>설문 마스터를 관리합니다.</p>
</section>
<!-- 페이지 헤더 끝 -->

<!-- 검색 시작 -->
<form class="search-panel" method="get" th:action="@{/admin/survey/list.do}">
    <div class="search-row">
        <label for="keyword">검색어</label>
        <input id="keyword" name="keyword" type="text">
    </div>
</form>
<!-- 검색 끝 -->

<!-- 리스트 시작 -->
<section class="list-panel">
    <table class="data-table">
        ...
    </table>
</section>
<!-- 리스트 끝 -->
```

## Block region comments

- Mark each **major block region** with paired start/end HTML comments so the screen area is easy to scan.
- Format: `<!-- {영역명} 시작 -->` immediately **before** the opening block element, and `<!-- {영역명} 끝 -->` immediately **after** the closing block element.
- Use short Korean names that match the screen purpose (e.g. `페이지 헤더`, `검색`, `리스트`, `알림`, `상세 폼`, `하단 버튼`).
- Pair every start comment with a matching end comment for the same region name.
- Do not add region comments for every nested inner element — only for top-level functional blocks within `<main>` (or equivalent content area).
- Keep the existing screen-purpose HTML comment at the top of the page; region comments are separate and mark layout blocks inside the page.
- Put **one blank line** after `<main>` (or equivalent content wrapper) before the first `<!-- … 시작 -->` comment.
- Put **one blank line** after the last `<!-- … 끝 -->` comment before `</main>` (or the wrapper closing tag).
- Put **one blank line** between consecutive region groups: after `<!-- … 끝 -->`, then before the next `<!-- … 시작 -->`.

```html
<!-- ❌ BAD — cramped against main boundaries -->
<main class="admin-content">
    <!-- 브레드크럼 시작 -->
    ...
    <!-- 하단 버튼 끝 -->
</main>

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<main class="admin-content">

    <!-- 브레드크럼 시작 -->
    ...
    <!-- 브레드크럼 끝 -->

    <!-- 페이지 헤더 시작 -->
    ...
    <!-- 페이지 헤더 끝 -->

    <!-- 하단 버튼 시작 -->
    ...
    <!-- 하단 버튼 끝 -->

</main>
```

## Thymeleaf notes

- Apply the same layout rules to `th:*` attributes and `th:block` wrappers.
- Keep Thymeleaf fragment inserts (`th:replace`, `th:insert`) on their own line like other block elements.
- Full-page templates must follow `thymeleaf-layout-dialect.mdc` (use `layouts/*` + `layout:decorate`; do not duplicate shell markup).
